      en: ["The Southern Arena in Bo was officially inaugurated in 2023.", "It serves as the home ground for Bo Rangers FC, the 2022 and 2023 league champions.", "The stadium features a state-of-the-art artificial turf playing surface.", "The seating capacity of the venue is approximately 6,000 all-seater units.", "It is notable for being the first stadium in Sierra Leone built entirely with private funds.", "The floodlight installation allows for nighttime matches in accordance with FIFA standards."],
